      "title": "Mass assignment in profile update",
      "description": "The profile action permits every user attribute from the request without a filter list. A caller can set admin or api_token on their own record. Any authenticated user can make themselves an admin. That user then gains every admin-only action. Permit only the editable profile fields, such as email.",
